# Prometheus Swarm CLI — Updated Streaming Design

## What Changed From v1

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Critical correction**: Only **Dissect** calls the LLM with `stream=True`. The other 5 agents are purely deterministic — no LLM calls anywhere. The design is updated below to reflect exactly what each agent can actually stream. Everything else you liked stays identical.

### The Per-Agent Streaming Truth Table

| Agent | LLM? | What It Actually Does | What We Stream |
|-------|------|----------------------|----------------|
| **Scout** | ❌ | Deterministic reasoning (`reasoning.py`) — dataset profiling, task detection, feature analysis | **Activity steps** as they happen: profiling → task detection → feature analysis → schema output |
| **Forge** | ❌ | F-string template generators, confidence router — architecture selection | **Decision steps**: candidate evaluation → architecture selection → script generation |
| **Furnace** | ❌ | Docker container management — trains inside containers | **Training progress**: epoch/fold progress bar + live metrics (loss, auc) as they arrive |
| **Dissect** | ✅ `stream=True` | LLM-powered crash diagnosis + patching | **Raw LLM tokens verbatim** (the Claude Code effect) + cascade level progression |
| **Arbiter** | ❌ | Deterministic metric computation + decision tree | **Metric results**: each metric as computed → threshold comparison → pass/fail decision |
| **Harbor** | ❌ | ONNX serialization + Docker compose deployment | **Deployment steps**: export → container build → health check → endpoint live |

