### Cost Tracker Update

The `cost_tracker.py` now also handles the terminal bell:

```python
def render_completion_line(duration: str, agent_count: int, tokens: int, cost: float, success: bool) -> str:
    bell = "\a"  # Terminal bell
    icon = "✔" if success else "✘"
    status = "Mission complete" if success else "Mission failed"
    return f"{bell}{'─' * width}\n  {icon} {status} · {duration} · {agent_count} agents · {tokens:,} tokens · ${cost:.4f}\n{'─' * width}"
```

